      "body": "Older musl headers expose `getdents64` as an alias for `getdents`, whose buffer parameter is `struct dirent *`. Passing the raw character buffer triggers an incompatible-pointer diagnostic. Pass it through `void *` to support both that interface and the glibc declaration.\n\nPorts PBS's [`patch-posixsubprocess-musl-getdents64.patch`](https://github.com/astral-sh/python-build-standalone/blob/0c5e581b54a4736cdbbe68bdd6d7e571a1dca11e/cpython-unix/patch-posixsubprocess-musl-getdents64.patch).\n\nCloses #160359.\n\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-160359 -->\n* Issue: gh-160359\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n",
